OL,3,GNEWSA'Utter surprise as Claudia
OL,4,AWinkleman wore my top'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clothes designer has spoken of her
OL,7,F"utter surprise" as Claudia Winkleman
OL,8,Fwore one of her creations for the
OL,9,Fpublicity shots for the BBC's Celebrity
OL,10,FTraitors show.
OL,12,FThe pictures show the host wearing the
OL,13,Fjacquard-knit "Lin" vest by luxury
OL,14,Fknitwear designer Genevieve Sweeney,
OL,15,Fwho is based near Bishop's Stortford,
OL,16,FHertfordshire.
OL,18,FShe was told two months ago that it
OL,19,Fwould be worn for the show, but she
OL,20,Fsaid she "never imagined for a minute
OL,21,Fthat it would be in this iconic look
OL,22,Ffor the main press imagery".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
